id: pm-ety1qc
title: "GH-919: _workspace author-attribution coordinates cannot be acknowledged"
description: "health emits actionable _workspace:<line> author-attribution coordinates that history-author-acknowledge rejects as malformed, leaving a strict-health failure with no supported CLI resolution."
