author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Author-attribution findings using the _workspace coordinate can be acknowledged through a documented stable command; acknowledgement preserves provenance and is visible to health and validation in a fresh clone; negative controls reject unknown workspace coordinates and tests cover CLI, SDK, and compact output receipts"
parent: pm-doxj
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Author-history selection now uses one SDK parser and transport normalizer for item IDs and _workspace:<line> coordinates across CLI and MCP."
expected_result: Workspace history author attribution accepts and validates _workspace coordinates with the same stable codes and semantics on every transport.
actual_result: "CLI registration delegates to SDK primitives, MCP shares transport normalization, and 14 author-attribution tests plus full integration gates pass."
